    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/b60611922ec2488be6b4e41d4debfce9.avif?t=1751295208\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boom Gear</strong> is a wild, high-energy demolition derby where crashing and smashing your way to victory is the only rule that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip behind the wheel of a rugged car and barrel into opponents in open-ended free play. Dodge obstacles, out manoeuvre rivals, and leave a trail of mayhem in your wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit counts\u2014rack up your score with epic takedowns and showcase your mastery of pure, arcade-style carnage. It\u2019s you against the metal jungle\u2014no mercy, just high-octane fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/0653c0eb9596490f0fd8d0ba908e462b.avif?t=1751295208\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car, your style, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, customization is your ticket to personalizing the destruction. Swap out car bodies for different looks\u2014from brawny bruisers to nimble compacts\u2014and bolt on wheels that suit your demolition style. Throw on a flashy paint job that screams attitude: neon grids, bold camo, or even colour splotches if that\u2019s your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination is up to you\u2014build your signature ride, and bring the pain in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/e4bb2cb1d5642fb01e04d9fec3d3b448.avif?t=1751295208\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demolition isn\u2019t just about smashing\u2014it\u2019s about building your ultimate ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you score big, you\u2019ll earn cash to unlock new car bodies and wheels through a random draw system. No rarities, no tiers\u2014just pure, unpredictable fun as you expand your garage with every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your collection to create wild combos, and keep experimenting until you find the ultimate setup that suits your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, every new part is a new way to crush the competition.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/b60611922ec2488be6b4e41d4debfce9.avif?t=1751295208\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boom Gear</strong> is a wild, high-energy demolition derby where crashing and smashing your way to victory is the only rule that matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip behind the wheel of a rugged car and barrel into opponents in open-ended free play. Dodge obstacles, out manoeuvre rivals, and leave a trail of mayhem in your wake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit counts\u2014rack up your score with epic takedowns and showcase your mastery of pure, arcade-style carnage. It\u2019s you against the metal jungle\u2014no mercy, just high-octane fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/0653c0eb9596490f0fd8d0ba908e462b.avif?t=1751295208\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your car, your style, your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, customization is your ticket to personalizing the destruction. Swap out car bodies for different looks\u2014from brawny bruisers to nimble compacts\u2014and bolt on wheels that suit your demolition style. Throw on a flashy paint job that screams attitude: neon grids, bold camo, or even colour splotches if that\u2019s your vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination is up to you\u2014build your signature ride, and bring the pain in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802640/extras/e4bb2cb1d5642fb01e04d9fec3d3b448.avif?t=1751295208\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demolition isn\u2019t just about smashing\u2014it\u2019s about building your ultimate ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you score big, you\u2019ll earn cash to unlock new car bodies and wheels through a random draw system. No rarities, no tiers\u2014just pure, unpredictable fun as you expand your garage with every victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your collection to create wild combos, and keep experimenting until you find the ultimate setup that suits your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Boom Gear</strong>, every new part is a new way to crush the competition.</p>",
